<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Christ to me is so subjective,</l><l>Life imparting all the way;</l><l>As the Spirit He revives me</l><l>And refreshes day by day.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Christ to me is so subjective,</l><l>All my being He transforms;</l><l>By the mind and will renewing</l><l>To His image He conforms.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Christ to me is so subjective,</l><l>Liberating pow’r is He,</l><l>By the law of life and power</l><l>As the Spirit setting free.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Christ to me is so subjective,</l><l>Regulating all the day;</l><l>He corrects and rules and guides me,</l><l>And adjusts in every way.</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>Christ to me is so subjective,</l><l>All my thirst He satisfies;</l><l>With His riches He supplies me,</l><l>Thus God’s fulness testifies.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
